  "label": "Ice Cream Shop",
  "description": "An ice cream shop is a type of retail establishment that sells ice cream and related products. The term 'ice cream shop' is culturally understood to imply a variety of offerings, including ice cream cones, sundaes, and shakes. The meme relies on this common understanding to create its humor — the expectation that an ice cream shop offers more than just shakes. This requires knowledge of common business types and consumer expectations.",
